o 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, January to February and February to March each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 56% of normal in August to September and 55% in September to October. Grid 29570 had its driest year in 1963 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
